+| Class | methods IMPLEMENTED (names) | vanilla file:lines read | BLOCKED with grep evidence |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Item | `byBlock` -> `Item::by_block` | `net/minecraft/world/item/Item.java:130-177, 285-286, 323-331, 407-420, 435-453, 470-472, 653-687` | None. Classifications for every other lead: `appendHoverText` INLINED (the base body is empty; grep for `append_hover_text`, `appendHoverText`, `get_tooltip`, and `tooltip_lines` found no server tooltip pipeline); `asItem` INLINED (item references are already direct and `ItemStack::get_item` handles empty-stack normalization); `attributes` DATA_MODELED (`AttributeModifiers`/`AttributeModifiersImpl`); `axe` DATA_MODELED (`ToolImpl` and the generated axes tag; `AxeItem` is the live behavior); `builtInRegistryHolder` DATA_MODELED (generated `Item { id, registry_key, components }` plus `Taggable` identity); `canDestroyBlock` RENAMED (`ItemBehaviour::can_mine`, called by `Player::can_break_block`); `component`, `components`, `delayedComponent`, `delayedHolderComponent` DATA_MODELED (generated item component tables and `ItemStack::get_data_component`); `craftRemainder` DATA_MODELED (`recipe_remainder::get_recipe_remainder_id`, called by crafting/brewing); `durability` DATA_MODELED (`MaxDamageImpl`, `DamageImpl`, and `MaxStackSizeImpl`); `effectiveDescriptionId` DATA_MODELED (`ItemNameImpl`/`Item::translated_name`); `effectiveModel` DATA_MODELED (`ItemModelImpl`); `enchantable` DATA_MODELED (`EnchantableImpl`); `equippable` and `equippableUnswappable` DATA_MODELED (`EquippableImpl.swappable`). Greps this run showed live consumers for each modeled/renamed path, including `get_data_component` consumers, `can_mine`, `get_recipe_remainder_id`, `translated_name`, and `Item::by_block`.` |
