Changes:

- Added generated `Item::by_block`, defaulting to `AIR`.
- Routed Java block-pick handling through it.
- Added unit coverage for stone and air.
- Classified all 19 leads in [WAVE_REPORT.md](/home/eshanki/pumpkin-wt/loose-coverage-2/WAVE_REPORT.md:4).
- Regenerated only the item output; removed unrelated generated diffs.
- `git diff --check` passes.
- No cargo build, clippy, or tests were run.
